{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QuantumObservableUniverses.ReebU1ChartSwap","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QuantumObservableUniverses.ReebU1ChartSwap","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Subgroup.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Category.Basic"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ChartSwap.eqReeb","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ChartSwap.eqReeb","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/reeb-u1-chart-swap.lean#L65-L72","doc":"**Theorem (chart-swap U(1) equals Reeb U(1)).** Given the\nabstract identification data `d : ChartSwapReebData G`, the\nchart-swap and Reeb subgroups of `G` coincide. The proof is the\none-line transitivity through the maximal torus `T_q`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:reeb-u1-chart-swap","label":"prop:reeb-u1-chart-swap","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/reeb-u1-chart-swap.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ChartSwap.ChartSwapReebData.reebFlow_eq_torus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ChartSwap.ChartSwapReebData.reebFlow_eq_torus","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/reeb-u1-chart-swap.lean#L63-L63","doc":"The Reeb U(1) factors through the canonical T_q action.\n(Step 2 of the .md proof: φ_t = exp(t ξ) is the one-parameter\nsubgroup of T_q generated by ξ = e_3 ∈ 𝔱_q.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ChartSwap.ChartSwapReebData.chartSwap_eq_torus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ChartSwap.ChartSwapReebData.chartSwap_eq_torus","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/reeb-u1-chart-swap.lean#L59-L59","doc":"The chart-swap U(1) factors through the canonical T_q action.\n(Step 3 of the .md proof: ρ_Θ is the standard T_q-scaling of\nthe affine coordinate Z on P(V) = G_q / T_q.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ChartSwap.ChartSwapReebData.reebFlow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ChartSwap.ChartSwapReebData.reebFlow","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/reeb-u1-chart-swap.lean#L55-L55","doc":"The Reeb-flow subgroup ⟨φ_t⟩ ⊆ Aut(P(V)). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ChartSwap.ChartSwapReebData.chartSwap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ChartSwap.ChartSwapReebData.chartSwap","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/reeb-u1-chart-swap.lean#L53-L53","doc":"The chart-swap subgroup ⟨ρ_Θ⟩ ⊆ Aut(P(V)). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ChartSwap.ChartSwapReebData.torusT","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ChartSwap.ChartSwapReebData.torusT","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/reeb-u1-chart-swap.lean#L51-L51","doc":"The maximal-torus subgroup T_q ⊆ Aut(P(V)). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ChartSwap.ChartSwapReebData.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ChartSwap.ChartSwapReebData.mk","kind":"ctor","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/reeb-u1-chart-swap.lean#L49-L49","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ChartSwap.ChartSwapReebData","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ChartSwap.ChartSwapReebData","kind":"structure","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/reeb-u1-chart-swap.lean#L45-L63","doc":"**Abstract setup.** A `ChartSwapReebData G` packages, for an\nabstract group `G` (the eventual `Aut(P(V))`), the two `U(1)`\nsubgroups whose equality is at issue, together with a `T_q`\nsubgroup factoring both. ","signatureChunk":0}]}